{title: Intehaan Ho Gayee}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Bappi Lahiri}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Intaha ho gai, [D]intazaar [Em]ki,        [Em]Aai na kuchh khabar, [D]mere yaar [Em]ki
[Am]Ye hamen hai yaqeen, [D]bevafa vo nahin,        [F#]Phir vajah kya hui, [B]intazaar [Em]ki
[Em]Baat jo hai us men, baat,        [C]Vo yahaan kahin nahin [D]kisi men
[D]Vo hai meri, bas hai meri,        [Bm]Shor hai yahi gali gali [Em]men
[Em]Saath saath vo hai mere,        [C]Gham men mere dil ki har [D]khushi men
[D]Zindagi men vo nahin to,        [Bm]Kuchh nahin hai meri zindagi [Em]men
[Em]Bujh na jaye [D]ye shama, [C]aitbar [Em]ki,        [Em]Intaha ho gai, [D]intazaar [Em]ki..
[Em]o, mere sajana,        [F#]Lo [A]main aa [Em]gai
[Em]Are, logon ne diye honge,        [F#]Bade bade nazaraane
[A]Laai hun main tere liye [Em]dil mera,        [Em]Dil yahi maange dua
[F#]ham kabhi ho na juda,        [A]Dil mera tera hai ye [Em]dil mera
[C]Ye meri [D]zindagi hai [Em]teri?        [Em]Tu mera [F#]sapna, [A]mai tuze [Em]pa gai
[Em]O, mere [F#]sajana, [A]lo main [Em]aa gai,        [Em]Ghamon ke andhere dhale
[F#]Bujhate sitaare jale,        [A]Dekha tujhe to dilon men [Em]jaan aai
[Em]Hothon pe taraane jage,        [F#]Aramaan deewaane jage
[A]Baahon men aa ke tu aise [Em]sharamaai,        [C]Chha gai phir [D]vohi be [Em]khudi
[Em]Vo ghadi kho gai [D]intazaar [Em]ki,        [Em]Aa gai rrut hasin, [D]rasm-e-yaar [Em]ki
[Am]Ye nasha ye khushi, [D]ab na kam ho kabhi,        [F#]Umr bhar na dhale, [B]raat pyaar [Em]ki
